{
  "id": "b2-e49-learning-practical-skills",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Learning practical skills",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, are you good with your hands?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you enjoy making or fixing things?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what practical skill would you most like to learn?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you remember learning a skill from a family member?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e49-a1",
            "b2-e49-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people making things. Compare the photographs, and say why the people might enjoy these activities.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, would you like to learn either of these skills?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e49-b1",
            "b2-e49-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people learning how to do things. Compare the photographs, and say what the advantages of these ways of learning might be.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you learn practical skills?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some practical skills that can be useful in life, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e49-learning-practical-skills",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these skills be useful in everyday life?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e49-learning-practical-skills",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most important for young people to learn?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about crafts and practical skills.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that schools should teach more practical skills. What do you think?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think people depend too much on professionals to fix things?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, why are handmade things more valuable to some people?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Will young people in the future need practical skills at all?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can you learn a skill without spending much money?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e49-learning-practical-skills/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
